# Dump / bygg / push

Do **not** dump, bygg, push, or update the release channel unless SVHA explicitly asks.

## Aliases

| Alias | Means |
|-------|--------|
| `dpu` | Dump, push, update (channel) — use the already-built EXE if present; do not rebuild unless needed |
| `dbpu` | Dump, bygg, push, update — rebuild first, then dump/push/channel |

Treat these aliases as full go-ahead for that sequence only. Small UI/code tweaks still wait for `dpu` / `dbpu` (or an explicit dump/bygg/push/update request).
